    {
      "subId": "7107405",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Muning",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710740601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710740601": {
            "id": "710740601",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Three more.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740602"
            ]
          },
          "710740602": {
            "id": "710740602",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "I shall gratefully take the Archaic Stones submitted by our two \"civic-minded citizens.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740603"
            ]
          },
          "710740603": {
            "id": "710740603",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "I didn't expect you to find two of them so quickly. And they are much better in quality than the ones I've previously seen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740604"
            ]
          },
          "710740604": {
            "id": "710740604",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "*sigh*... They remind me of the one that I used to have.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740605"
            ]
          },
          "710740605": {
            "id": "710740605",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You have an Archaic Stone?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740608"
            ]
          },
          "710740608": {
            "id": "710740608",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "I mean I USED to have one.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740609"
            ]
          },
          "710740609": {
            "id": "710740609",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "My old man once handled a batch of ores at Shenglu Hall. That stone was just a leftover remnant and its quality was poor, so he gave it to me as a toy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740610"
            ]
          },
          "710740610": {
            "id": "710740610",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "We had been arguing all the time back then. I never had a job. And to make it worse, I spent most of my time at Yanshang Teahouse. As such, I ended up in heavy debt — and in distress too...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740611"
            ]
          },
          "710740611": {
            "id": "710740611",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740612"
            ]
          },
          "710740612": {
            "id": "710740612",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "That feels a bit wrong...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740613"
            ]
          },
          "710740613": {
            "id": "710740613",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Well, who hasn't done a stupid thing or two when they were young? Anyway, when I was helpless...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740614"
            ]
          },
          "710740614": {
            "id": "710740614",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Someone recognized my Archaic Stone and offered a good price. To me, it was no big deal — a stone in exchange for some Mora to get me out of my immediate predicament. A fair trade I'd say.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740615"
            ]
          },
          "710740615": {
            "id": "710740615",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Yet my father brought this up the other day and asked, \"Muning, where did you put the stone that I gave you?\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740616"
            ]
          },
          "710740616": {
            "id": "710740616",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "All I could tell him was, \"It's just a stone. I've long lost it.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740617"
            ]
          },
          "710740617": {
            "id": "710740617",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Though I said so, I couldn't help wondering what if I hadn't sold the stone — then I could show it to Father when he mentioned it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740618"
            ]
          },
          "710740618": {
            "id": "710740618",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "...Forget it. It's no use wondering about the what-if now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740619"
            ]
          },
          "710740619": {
            "id": "710740619",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "At least the prodigal son has returned.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740620"
            ]
          },
          "710740620": {
            "id": "710740620",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "You are right... It's just that I still have a long way to go before I can clear my debt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740621"
            ]
          },
          "710740621": {
            "id": "710740621",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "I've digressed. Do bring me the stones if you find more."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7107406",
      "subQuestName": "Obtain 3 Archaic Stones for Muning",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7107407",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Muning",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710740801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710740801": {
            "id": "710740801",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "With these three included, it's nine in total. They should be enough.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740802"
            ]
          },
          "710740802": {
            "id": "710740802",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "You managed to gather what Huishan Hall needs so quickly. No wonder they speak so highly of you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740803"
            ]
          },
          "710740803": {
            "id": "710740803",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh, it was easy! Easy-peasy, lemon-breezy!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740804"
            ]
          },
          "710740804": {
            "id": "710740804",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I'm sure it's \"lemon-squeezy,\" Paimon...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740805"
            ]
          },
          "710740805": {
            "id": "710740805",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? Uh, well, lemons can be breezy too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740806"
            ]
          },
          "710740806": {
            "id": "710740806",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Oh, look at you, forcing your logic through. Most impressive.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740807"
            ]
          },
          "710740807": {
            "id": "710740807",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Haha... We've all witnessed your heroic deeds of fighting the sea monster. I believe it was no challenge for you to accomplish such a feat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740810"
            ]
          },
          "710740810": {
            "id": "710740810",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Well, so much for being a Ministry staff member. They still ask you to do things like \"look for Archaic Stone in The Chasm\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740811"
            ]
          },
          "710740811": {
            "id": "710740811",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Speaking of which, you said you often argued with your father back then and didn't have a job.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740812"
            ]
          },
          "710740812": {
            "id": "710740812",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Then how did you make it into the Ministry later?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740813"
            ]
          },
          "710740813": {
            "id": "710740813",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "You know how I owed a big sum at the time? I could turn to no one, nor was I willing to go home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740814"
            ]
          },
          "710740814": {
            "id": "710740814",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "In the end, the debt collectors came looking for my old man at the Shenglu Hall... I thought he'd come find me to break my legs upon hearing the news.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740815"
            ]
          },
          "710740815": {
            "id": "710740815",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But your legs look fine.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740816"
            ]
          },
          "710740816": {
            "id": "710740816",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Yes... It's embarrassing to say, but he cleared my debt and came looking for me. By the time he found me, I was almost like a beaten-up dog on the street. He said, \"I have all your IOUs, so now you're indebted to me.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740817"
            ]
          },
          "710740817": {
            "id": "710740817",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "With that, he forced me to work — to pay my debt.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740818"
            ]
          },
          "710740818": {
            "id": "710740818",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So your father is your creditor now.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740819"
            ]
          },
          "710740819": {
            "id": "710740819",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "You can say that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740820"
            ]
          },
          "710740820": {
            "id": "710740820",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Back then, with the debt collectors after me, I couldn't even fall asleep at night. So, I swore that I'd mend my ways if I was given a second chance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740821"
            ]
          },
          "710740821": {
            "id": "710740821",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "But I didn't expect the chance to come from my father, who always disapproved of my behaviors...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740822"
            ]
          },
          "710740822": {
            "id": "710740822",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "He didn't lash out at me as usual. Instead, we had a talk — an honest and sincere one. How I wish we could've talked this way earlier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740823"
            ]
          },
          "710740823": {
            "id": "710740823",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "But even if he'd been open for a talk, I wouldn't have been willing to listen.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740824"
            ]
          },
          "710740824": {
            "id": "710740824",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Looks like your father treats you well.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740825"
            ]
          },
          "710740825": {
            "id": "710740825",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Yeah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740826"
            ]
          },
          "710740826": {
            "id": "710740826",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "So I have to get my job done well under whatever circumstances.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740827"
            ]
          },
          "710740827": {
            "id": "710740827",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Whether it's the incident in The Chasm or looking for Archaic Stones for Huishan Hall.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740828"
            ]
          },
          "710740828": {
            "id": "710740828",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I believe I'm the one who did the job for you this time...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740829"
            ]
          },
          "710740829": {
            "id": "710740829",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "Having people get the job done also counts.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740830"
            ]
          },
          "710740830": {
            "id": "710740830",
            "speakerId": 2061,
            "speakerName": "Muning",
            "text": "But still, it's all thanks to you that we moved swimmingly — I'd say it was way more quickly than I expected.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710740831"
            ]
          },
          "710740831": {
            "id": "710740831",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, Paimon finally senses a touch of gratitude there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
